    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88972.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 80,
    "turn_text": "I think one thing the Republican Party did nationally much better than the Democrats is finding a message and sticking with it. And the Republican message was everything is the president's fault, right? Whatever the facts may be, let's just keep saying everything's the President's fault. And they counted on the majority of people, those who were paying attention, to buy into that. And counted on the fact that we in our busy lives or don't have the time or the inclination to sort of dig deep on some important issues.",
