      },
      {
        "text": "Effective political communication relies on exploiting psychological tendencies like confirmation bias and heuristics.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The Democratic Party fails to maintain a unified or compelling narrative compared to Republicans.",
