    "turn_text": "Thank you for having me on the scrum, Adam. It's been my pleasure of my treat. And thanks for Spending some time with me here at Capital Coffee. Come by, get some coffee, and some breakfast. Tell them most sent you. It'll still cost the same, but you'll enjoy the meal.",
